sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Supervisor
    participant Planner
    participant GraphRAG
    participant Validator
    participant Executor
    participant Verifier

    User->>Supervisor: "Buffer hospitals by 5km and find intersecting flood zones"
    Supervisor->>Planner: Route request
    Planner->>GraphRAG: Query "hospital buffer QGIS methodology"
    GraphRAG-->>Planner: RRF Merged Result (Qdrant + Neo4j)
    Planner->>Validator: Draft ToolSteps (Buffer, Spatial Join)
    Validator-->>Planner: Approve ToolSteps
    Planner-->>User: [Human-in-the-Loop] Request Approval
    User->>Planner: Approve Execution Plan
    Planner->>Executor: Execute Steps
    Executor->>Executor: Run PyQGIS native:buffer
    Executor->>Executor: Run native:joinattributesbylocation
    Executor->>Verifier: Pass output layers
    Verifier->>Verifier: Check CRS match, topology, raster stats
    Verifier-->>Supervisor: Verification passed
    Supervisor-->>User: Final Output Map & Report
